### Secrets ###
# .env holds real local credentials read via `spring.config.import=optional:file:.env[.properties]`
# in application.properties -- it must never be committed. Only .env.example (placeholders) is tracked.
.env
# Google Cloud Console credential downloads -- these contain a real OAuth client secret.
client_secret_*.json

